name: protocol-shape
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: true
note: the wire protocol's structural contract changed — who emits, who
      reads, ordering obligations, blocking semantics. Declared 2026-10-06:
      say went from a disguised RPC (emit + block for the reply) to a pure
      write with a ledgered inbound obligation (outstanding_user -> pull).
      Fires when a change alters what a turn *is*, not what a turn says.
